@startuml
title Activity Diagram: UC-02 Manage Inquiry

skinparam linetype ortho

|Customer|
start
:Select "Inquiries" / "Contact Us" on website\n(or AI Chatbot conversation escalates);
:Fill out inquiry form\n(name, contact details, email, message);
:Submit inquiry;

|System|
:Validate that all required fields are completed;

if (All required fields valid?) then (Yes)
  :Create new inquiry record with status "Open"\nand assign a reference number;
  :Display confirmation message with reference number;
  :Add inquiry to Staff/Admin dashboard queue;

  |Staff/Admin|
  :Open inquiry from dashboard and review details;

  |System|
  :Display inquiry details and related order/account history;

  |Staff/Admin|
  :Draft and send reply to customer;

  |System|
  :Deliver reply via email and\nupdate inquiry status to "Answered";

  |Customer|
  :Read reply;

  if (Customer responds again or needs further help?) then (Yes)
    :Send follow-up response;
    
    |Staff/Admin|
    :Review follow-up and draft another reply;
    
    |System|
    :Update inquiry status to "Answered";
    
    |Customer|
    :Read updated response;
  else (No)
  endif

  |System|
  if (No further response within set period or Staff/Admin closes it?) then (Yes)
    :Update inquiry status to "Closed";
  else (No)
    :Keep inquiry active;
  endif

else (No)
  |System|
  :Highlight invalid/missing fields and\nprevent submission until corrected;
  
  |Customer|
  :Correct details and resubmit;
endif

|System|
stop
@enduml
